# Secrets. LICENSE_SECRET mints Pro licences and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is billable —
# neither may ever be committed. Leaking LICENSE_SECRET means anyone can issue
# themselves unlimited Pro keys, and the only remedy is rotating it, which
# invalidates every paying customer's key at once.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
.vercel/

# Obsidian's own workspace/UI state if you open this repo as a vault — local
# to your machine, not part of the actual notes.
.obsidian/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
